  "identity": "A Dimir tempo deck whose threats are priced by its own graveyard. Ten cheap instants and sorceries answer the opponent's board and, once spent, discount Tolarian Terror toward {1}{U} and grow Haughty Djinn's power. Founding the Third Path and Vohar actively bank instants and sorceries so the discount arrives on schedule rather than by accident. The kill is combat damage from a ward-2 5/5 Serpent and a scaling flier, protected by counterspells held up on the same turn the threat lands.",
